{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34220","headline":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 渔庵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 渔庵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结茅次烟水，用以资啸傲。\n岂谓钓家流，忽同禅室号。\n闲凭山叟占，晚有溪禽嫪。\n华屋莫相非，各随吾所好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}